OL,3,AMarvel fans to meet Welsh superhero -
OL,4,Acomplete with Cardiff accent
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarvel fans around the world are set to
OL,7,Fmeet a Welsh villain - complete with a
OL,8,FCardiff accent.
OL,10,FLauren Morais, from the Welsh capital,
OL,11,Fwill play Lisa Molinari in the new
OL,12,Fsuperhero series VisionQuest - a
OL,13,Fspin-off from the miniseries
OL,14,FWandaVision.
OL,16,FThe Disney+ show, exploring whether AI
OL,17,Fand humanity can co-exist, also stars
OL,18,FPaul Bettany, returning as Vision, and
OL,19,FJames Spader as Ultron.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,166,160,200,105,0,100
