OL,3,AMarvel fans to meet Welsh superhero -
OL,4,Acomplete with Cardiff accent
OL,5,
OL,6,FMorais said getting the role was a
OL,7,F"pinch me" moment and that she was
OL,8,F"very proud" to introduce her accent to
OL,9,Fthe Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU).
